      "citations": null,
      "text": "The SMB factor is the average of the three small-cap value-weighted portfolios minus the average of the three big-cap value-weighted portfolios. The script takes the monthly value-weighted table from the file, treats the first three columns as small and the last three as big, and skips any month with a missing value.\n\n```python\nimport csv\nimport numpy as np\n\nIN_FILE = \"6_Portfolios_2x3.csv\"\nOUT_FILE = \"output.csv\"\nMISSING = (-99.99, -999.0)\n\n\ndef is_missing(v):\n    return any(np.isclose(v, m) for m in MISSING)\n\n\ndef main():\n    with open(IN_FILE, encoding=\"latin-1\") as f:\n        lines = f.read().splitlines()\n\n    # Locate the value-weighted monthly section\n    start = None\n    for i, line in enumerate(lines):\n        if \"value weighted returns -- monthly\" in line.lower():\n            start = i\n            break\n    if start is None:\n        raise RuntimeError(\"Value-weighted monthly section not found\")\n\n    records = []\n    started = False\n    for line in lines[start + 1:]:\n        parts = [p.strip() for p in line.split(\",\")]\n        is_data = len(parts) >= 7 and parts[0].isdigit() and len(parts[0]) == 6\n        if is_data:\n            started = True\n            try:\n                vals = [float(x) for x in parts[1:7]]\n            except ValueError:\n                vals = None\n            records.append((int(parts[0]), vals))\n        else:\n            if started:\n                # End of the monthly block (blank line or next section/footer)\n                break\n\n    out = []\n    for date, vals in records:\n        if vals is None or any(is_missing(v) for v in vals) or any(np.isnan(v) for v in vals):\n            continue\n        small = np.mean(vals[0:3])\n        big = np.mean(vals[3:6])\n        out.append((date, small - big))\n\n    with open(OUT_FILE, \"w\", newline=\"\") as f:\n        w = csv.writer(f)\n        w.writerow([\"date\", \"value\"])\n        for date, val in out:\n            w.writerow([date, repr(float(val))])\n\n\nif __name__ == \"__main__\":\n    main()\n```",
      "type": "text"
    }
